@startuml
left to right direction

actor Player

rectangle "Client App" as App {
    [UI]
    [API Requests]
}

rectangle "Relay Server" as Relay {
    [Flask API]
    [OpenAI Integration]
    [Game State Management]
    [Rule Evaluation]
}

rectangle "Game Logic Engine" as Logic {
    [Rule Evaluator]
    [Rule Executor]
    [Game Logic Injection]
}

database "Game State (Redis)" as State {
    [Player State]
    [Narrative Flags]
    [Inventory]
}

folder "Rule Store (JSON)" as Rules {
    [Rule Definitions]
    [Schemas]
}

rectangle "Prompt Augmentation" as Prompt {
    [Dynamic Prompt Builder]
    [Game State Summary]
}

rectangle "OpenAI API" as OpenAI {
    [Chat Completions]
    [Narrative Generation]
}

folder "Testing Suite" as Tests {
    [Unit Tests]
    [AI Simulations]
    [Rule Validation]
}

Player --> App : Interacts with UI
App --> Relay : Sends API Requests
Relay --> State : Reads/Writes Game State
Relay --> Rules : Loads Rule Definitions
Relay --> Logic : Evaluates Rules
Logic --> State : Updates Game State
Logic --> Rules : Validates Rules
Relay --> Prompt : Augments Prompt with State
Relay --> OpenAI : Sends Chat Completion Request
OpenAI --> Relay : Returns AI Response
Relay --> App : Sends Response to Player
Tests --> Relay : Simulates API Calls
Tests --> Logic : Validates Rule Execution
Tests --> State : Tests Game State Persistence

@enduml